WEBVTT

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:08.000
So, your name is Lina Inverse?

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:11.700
Me?

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.110
My name is...

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.710
What was that?

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.310
Oh, whatever...

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:02.080
What's wrong, Brother?

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:04.220
My God, his leg is broken!

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:05.750
Lady!

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.890
Hey, Lady!

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:18.530
Hey, wait a minute! I said wait!

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.410
Don't you need more exercise?

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:23.930
You think so?

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:26.780
Well actually my blood pressure hasn't
been doing too well.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.110
Yeah, and you know, I got this...

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:33.250
Hey! We're not here to talk
about your health!

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:37.190
So, what do you have to say for
yourself! You broke our brother's leg!

00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:42.100
Brother! Brother!

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:45.360
Setting aside minor details...

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:50.600
Yeah that's right, if you want to live,
then hand over all your money.

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:55.140
Would you people happen to be in the
profession of banditry?

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.980
Well, there are those that
refer to us as such.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:00.210
Then you're bad people, aren't you?

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.340
Oh, you're much too kind.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:04.510
She's not praising you!

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:07.850
Hey, you catch on quickly, Lady.

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:11.160
Hear ye spirits of the earth,

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:15.690
honor your vow in this hour of need
and do my bidding.

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:17.560
Right!

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:23.260
Explosion Array!

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:41.080
Lucky!

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.340
Delicious! Delicious! Delicious!

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:07.470
When you come to the ocean,

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.850
you can't pass this up!

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:15.950
It took us a while to find you.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.190
We underestimated you before,

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:23.130
but this time we have a
trusty ally with us.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.530
You, you...

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:29.090
Aren't you going to flee in terror?!

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.370
No way, I'm having lunch right now.

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.170
All right then.

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:36.070
Lady, it's your turn!

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.640
What sort of reckless person
would dare oppose

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:50.590
the world's most beautiful, intelligent
and powerful sorceress, the Lady Naga?!

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:54.320
What in heaven's name are you up to now?

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:56.130
Oh, if it isn't Lina.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:59.100
So it was you? They did mention
something about highway robbery

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:03.040
and a feather brained, bully of
a sorceress with no cleavage.

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:06.470
Oh whatever, time to get to work.
Don't take this personally...

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:09.310
Fireball.

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:12.200
What?!

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:16.140
You're mean, Lina.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:19.620
Look who's talking.
Don't you ever learn?

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:24.460
Besides, they're the bad guys. Aren't
you ashamed to be working for them?

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:25.720
Oh really?

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.320
Yes, really. Take one look at them!

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:31.760
But they always say that you should
never judge a book by its cover.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.000
I can't fault you for that...

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.830
Nevertheless, these guys are bad guys!

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:39.530
I see, if that's the case,

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:41.940
I'll cooperate with you.

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:45.210
Hey, wait a minute!
We gave you a retainer!

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:47.480
Abide by our contract!

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:53.010
It so happens the law says you don't
have to honor pacts with bad people.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.720
No, no, no, no! There is no such law!

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.320
In any case...

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.330
We!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.050
Don't!

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:00.080
Care!

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:10.400
They sure didn't pack much.

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.130
Really?

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:14.870
Could you at least tell us your name?

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.470
Me? My name is Lina Inverse.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.210
Then, then you are...

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.270
Not the...

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:25.480
Lina Dragon, the Robber Killer!

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:27.720
Please, forgive us!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.190
We didn't know!

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:34.960
I beg you, do what you will with me,
but don't harm my family!

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:39.130
My wife and daughter have
nothing to do with this!

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:44.800
Anyway, aside from that "Robber Killer"
business, what do you mean by "Dragon"?

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.140
Um... well, you know,

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:52.480
"...even the mighty dragon
would run away..."

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.880
Oh my God! Hurry Lina!
We have no time for this!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.350
Wh... what is it?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.720
We're not gonna make it!

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:04.520
What are you talking about?!

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:07.550
We're running out of time!

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.060
Oh, thank God!

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.860
Good bye!

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:28.940
Setting sail for Mipross Island,
all aboard!

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:35.750
Cheers!

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:45.260
So those coupons were discount tickets
for the hot springs on Mipross Island.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.530
But why did you bring me along with you?

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:54.270
Oh you know, you were just there,
and why the hell not?

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.830
Didn't you want to come?

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:59.810
Well, the food isn't too bad,
so I don't mind.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.310
Oh, I'd like another serving please.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:05.080
Another...

00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:13.960
Why are we stuck in a room like this?

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.390
What did you expect?

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:21.430
These tickets are for the economy
discount rate package.

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:25.700
Naga, what's the deal
with Mipross Island?

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.900
You wanna know?

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:38.080
According to the World
Hot Springs Guide,

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.490
"The hot springs of Mipross Island are
rated at five stars out of five."

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:44.120
"The springs are the dream of
every true hot springs fan."

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:50.260
"They have amazing medicinal powers,
but that's not the real secret."

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.830
Are you listening, Lina?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:03.210
"Mipross Island is known for the nearly
impenetrable fog that surrounds it."

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.510
"Fog so dense that birds cannot
fly through it."

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:10.310
"But at this time each year, when Fairy
Souls are just starting to appear,"

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:16.310
"the island unveils itself and accepts
people from the continent."

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:17.620
"And..."

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:20.150
Here, you see. Right here.

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:24.150
"According to stories exchanged between
those who have visited the island,"

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:30.630
"there's a site where you can look back
to the time elves inhabited the area."

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:36.540
"There, the past and the present overlap
allowing you a glimpse of the future."

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:45.350
"Now, people refer to this island,
as the 'Promised Island'."

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:04.760
Where am I? What am I doing here?

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.740
I got it!

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:15.310
Isn't it hot?

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:17.150
I'm fine.

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:22.490
Pretty soon the Fairy Souls
will be everywhere.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.920
That's when the village will celebrate.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.160
Can I come?

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:34.530
Excuse me, I'm sorry to
bother you but...

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:36.500
Is there something wrong?

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:40.800
Father and Mother don't approve of
me seeing a human like you.

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:43.240
Hey, you kids.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:44.940
I don't care.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:48.250
It doesn't worry me either.

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:50.340
I can't believe these two.

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.910
It's getting late. I have to go home.

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:56.820
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:02.390
Hey, wait!

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:15.070
I see, I must be dreaming.

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:20.240
I see that little gets by Lina Inverse.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:24.120
Yeah, whatever. Who gave you permission
to mess with my dreams?

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:29.020
Sorry about that, but I couldn't get
permission, because you were asleep.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.720
Of course!

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:34.660
Calm down. In any case...

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:40.260
Welcome to Mipross Island!

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:43.240
Old Man, who in world are you?

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:49.040
The fun is only beginning.

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:05.630
This is so good, Naga.

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:12.920
Hey, watch it!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.430
Like takin' candy from a baby.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:25.470
What the hell do ya'
think you're doin'?!

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:31.440
That's my line. Taking things from
people without permission is theft.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:33.280
What?!

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:39.190
That's right, you're gonna get hurt
if you keep this up.

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:40.920
Hey, Brother!

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:46.930
What was that about keeping it up? Huh?

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:49.900
Ah c'mon, you know.

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.740
Bad boys get punished.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:04.410
Embarrassing me is going to cost you!
I've had enough of your excuses.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:07.320
Beg and plead all you like,
but it won't change a thing!

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:09.020
So, what are you gonna do now?

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:11.920
What do you mean?
You're the ones that brought us here.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:15.790
You're quite the smart-ass, aren't you?

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:21.390
Enough already. I am the tenth
strongest man on this island.

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:24.030
This is your last chance to
repent and leave.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.900
Yeah, yeah sure.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:28.330
Explosion Array!

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.080
Next?

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.410
You're pretty good.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:43.860
But I am the eighth strongest
man on this island.

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:46.290
And I'm the seventh.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:52.290
As for myself, behold,
I am the fifth strongest man!

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.800
What do you think of that?!

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:56.300
Ya' ready to give up?!

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:58.700
Well in that case, all together now.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:00.940
Fireball!

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:14.680
That was quite a feat. I'm impressed.

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:21.880
Would you happen to be...

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:23.730
Lina Inverse.

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:27.720
As I thought, the world renown,
Lina Inverse.

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:30.570
And who is your companion?

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.630
I am Lina's most powerful and
foremost rival...

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.870
My sidekick, Naga.

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:38.900
How can you say that, Lina?

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:42.910
Why do you care? Who are you, anyway?

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:48.350
There are those who call me Sorcerer A.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:51.850
So, what is your business with us, A?

00:13:51.890 --> 00:14:01.360
I thought it was time to expose Lina
Inverse to the marvels of the world.

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:04.530
A magic field?

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:12.240
Prepare to depart life as you witness
the most frightening sight known to man!

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:16.580
The ultimate incantation spell,
Summon Jelly Fish!

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.910
Naga, what is this?

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:22.790
Sea Cucumber Spin!

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:48.540
I should've seen this coming.

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:57.090
You're pretty good.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.860
You're not too bad yourself.

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:12.130
He was quite a challenge.

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:16.580
That's the least of our concerns!
What are we going to do with all this?!

00:15:20.220 --> 00:15:22.680
They taste good pickled.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:26.690
You have a point there.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:33.190
I see what you mean, these really
are fresh. I'll take 'em!

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:34.320
Thank you!

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:35.800
Lina!

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:39.670
Look.

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:56.080
How weird...

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:00.120
Wonderful!

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:01.780
How cute!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:06.420
Isn't it adorable?!

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.730
Look at this!

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:12.100
Don't you think it's awfully strange?

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.330
Yes, and in very bad taste.

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:17.400
I don't really think that's
the issue here.

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:36.880
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:43.230
We welcome all visitors from the
continent to Mipross.

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:49.600
It seems another year has passed. I am
Lagos, guide to the world of dreams.

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:54.130
Dear Lady, where might you be from?

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:58.040
Why, we're all from Sangoost.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:03.810
I see, Sangoost is far to the south.

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:08.310
Of Sangoost, I hear the mountains supply
wonderful scenery for fine dining.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:10.920
This guy's a master of illusion.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:17.090
Picturesque mountains and beautiful
nature surround the valley.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:21.230
But look there! And there!

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:25.100
He uses intricate hypnotic suggestions
to draw them into a world of illusion.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:31.310
Aren't those the Sangoost Mushrooms,
famous for their wonderful aroma?

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:37.650
Being from Sangoost, they must be seeing
the mountains and rivers of their home.

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:44.890
Now, let's clap together and welcome
the fall festivities of Sangoost.

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.990
But...

00:17:57.710 --> 00:17:59.730
Are their brains completely rotten?!

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:04.140
Hey, you know, meat tastes best
just before it spoils.

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:22.060
I'm taking the first dive!

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:33.800
Oh, this is the five star hot
springs of my dreams.

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:38.250
Just feel this texture...

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:41.240
This smell...

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:43.750
This taste... Why this is...

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:47.950
Hi everyone!
We're the Hot Springs Sisters.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:49.960
I'm Shampoo.

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:51.620
I'm Rinse.

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:53.520
I'm Lufa.

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:55.050
And so...

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:59.090
We will be your guides to
the hot springs tonight.

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:02.530
And now, a word about the pride of
this hotel, our hot springs!

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:05.540
This hot spring is renowned for its
healing effect on all manner of ills.

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:10.440
Thanks to its epidermal benefits,
it is known as the spring of beauty.

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:12.280
And what about its ingredients?

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:17.620
To the natural spring water are added
other medicinal ingredients

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:20.640
to provide an exquisite blend.

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:29.520
You've got some nerve! Calling this an
"exquisite blend" is totally shameless.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.530
Oh no!

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:34.690
First of all, this hot spring
is far from natural.

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:37.070
Oh no! Oh no!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.830
For you see,

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:45.940
this aroma, the artificial smell that
stimulates the back of the nostrils,

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:50.350
is the famous mixture from Tranvargen,
"Hot Springs of the Northlands".

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:51.720
And...

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:55.810
Yes, this, this artificial flavoring
that clings to the tip of the tongue...

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:59.420
Why I think this is a substance commonly
sold in the Miranda region,

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:02.760
"The herbal hot spring that's a
delicious drink: Miranda's Mix."

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:08.130
I would guess the two are blended
together in a 60/40 mix.

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:10.260
Well, am I mistaken?

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:15.370
Naga, that's incredible!

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:19.270
But of course.

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:24.550
You may get away with deceiving an
amateur, but you won't get past Naga's

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:27.540
sensitive skin.

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:46.730
Nice to meet you, I'm Juliano Jubibieno,
the owner of this establishment.

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:48.110
Aren't you an interesting person.

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:50.440
I am humbled by your praise.

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:54.310
So, as an interesting person, are you
going to take responsibility for this?

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.320
Yes, well you see,

00:20:56.350 --> 00:21:01.340
even if the hot springs are fake, so
long as the customers desires are met,

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:02.880
our business is legitimate.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.220
Well, I'm not satisfied.

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:08.790
One disgruntled person cannot out weigh
hundreds of satisfied customers.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:12.420
Then you'll give me a refund
for my dissatisfaction?

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:16.930
Unfortunately, because you are staying
on a discount voucher, I cannot.

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:18.700
You certainly are a cheapskate.

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:21.900
Oh, I'm nothing compared to you.

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:28.440
Well, I'll leave the rest up to you.

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:36.910
What's your hurry? The fun is only
beginning, Ms. Lina Inverse.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.350
Get out of the way, Naga!

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.900
Who are you anyway?

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:53.300
I'm just a hotel owner that likes
to rip off customers

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:56.000
using his favorite hot springs
in order to build up capital,

00:21:56.040 --> 00:22:00.410
enlarge his chain and, eventually
expand to the continent.

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:06.350
In short, I want to conquer the world!

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:14.720
Then I have no reason to go
easy on you, do I?

00:22:14.760 --> 00:22:15.820
As you wish...

00:22:15.860 --> 00:22:18.830
Demon Wind!
Freeze Arrow!

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:29.330
Now it's my turn.

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:37.310
This is getting intense, isn't it?
Here, have some more.

00:22:37.350 --> 00:22:39.440
Oh, why thank you...

00:22:39.490 --> 00:22:41.350
Then I would like the Pannon Juice.

00:22:41.390 --> 00:22:45.790
Sure! Pannon Juice for the
customer from Room 26:

00:22:55.440 --> 00:22:59.500
So, where do you rank on this
island's tough guy list?

00:22:59.740 --> 00:23:06.580
It would appear that I am in 3rd place,
if you don't include the Great Master.

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:08.140
The Great Master?

00:23:08.180 --> 00:23:10.810
That's nothing you should
be worried about.

00:23:10.850 --> 00:23:12.750
You're right.

00:23:13.220 --> 00:23:15.920
Fireball!

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:26.530
My God!

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:28.030
Naga!

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:30.970
Spiritual Curse!

00:23:41.680 --> 00:23:43.240
Vibration Blast!

00:24:03.970 --> 00:24:06.630
You're pretty good.

00:24:11.080 --> 00:24:12.670
His magical field is gone?

00:24:15.750 --> 00:24:18.620
First in line, Lina Inverse, here I go!

00:24:20.990 --> 00:24:22.980
What?!

00:24:23.720 --> 00:24:27.250
Explosion Array!

00:24:52.750 --> 00:24:55.090
Tomorrow is the village festival.

00:24:55.260 --> 00:24:56.850
Wear this ring of flowers when you come.

00:24:56.890 --> 00:24:58.050
Will it be all right?

00:24:59.790 --> 00:25:04.060
Oh no, not this stupid dream again.

00:25:04.100 --> 00:25:07.690
Old Man!
I know you can hear me, Old Man!

00:25:07.740 --> 00:25:08.790
What is it?

00:25:08.840 --> 00:25:13.830
Don't "what is it?" me! Isn't it about
time you explained what's going on here?

00:25:13.870 --> 00:25:17.110
Actually, I'm a very shy man.

00:25:17.140 --> 00:25:21.340
You won't let me see you or tell me who
you are. That's a little beyond shy.

00:25:21.380 --> 00:25:25.110
Well I know, but I can't help
it if I get embarrassed.

00:25:25.150 --> 00:25:29.320
My point exactly! Why should you get
embarrassed over these children...

00:25:34.800 --> 00:25:36.590
That's right.

00:25:40.270 --> 00:25:41.730
Rowdy?

00:25:45.640 --> 00:25:51.940
You and I will live peacefully together
no matter what happens, right?

00:25:53.050 --> 00:25:55.410
Of course.

00:25:55.450 --> 00:25:57.180
It's a promise.

00:26:02.620 --> 00:26:04.780
Isn't this over yet?

00:26:14.340 --> 00:26:18.200
Thank you so very much.

00:26:18.240 --> 00:26:20.970
We don't know what to say to
show our appreciation.

00:26:21.010 --> 00:26:24.100
We were wondering if you might be
gracious enough to perform another task.

00:26:24.140 --> 00:26:28.310
Could you take him to our king?

00:26:28.350 --> 00:26:33.050
We know this isn't much, but could you
accept this as a token of our gratitude.

00:26:33.090 --> 00:26:37.680
We humbly beg you to do this for us.

00:26:41.760 --> 00:26:44.030
You know Lina,

00:26:44.060 --> 00:26:45.730
it's about time...

00:26:45.770 --> 00:26:47.530
For something to happen, right?

00:26:51.540 --> 00:26:56.500
Well well, we've been expecting you,
Ms. Lina Inverse.

00:26:56.540 --> 00:26:58.600
Did you come to get him back?

00:26:58.650 --> 00:27:03.480
Of course not. We wouldn't dare do
such a thing in your presence.

00:27:03.680 --> 00:27:09.850
But we are professionals, and there is a
matter of some pride to be addressed.

00:27:09.890 --> 00:27:12.920
Pride, huh?

00:27:12.960 --> 00:27:15.860
Incidentally Ms. Lina, where
might you be from?

00:27:15.900 --> 00:27:18.870
Oh, me? Zephillia. Oh no!

00:27:20.940 --> 00:27:22.990
Zephillia was it?

00:27:23.440 --> 00:27:24.930
Such a magnificent place, Zephillia!

00:27:24.970 --> 00:27:29.970
The harvests are so bountiful they seem
like a gift from the gods.

00:27:31.050 --> 00:27:32.600
With one bite of the luscious fruit,

00:27:32.650 --> 00:27:37.240
the rich, sweet flavor spreads
throughout the mouth,

00:27:37.280 --> 00:27:40.250
prompting one to lose himself
in the taste.

00:27:40.290 --> 00:27:41.450
Yes!

00:27:41.490 --> 00:27:46.390
That is the unequalled reputation of
the marvelous grapes of Zephillia.

00:27:48.400 --> 00:27:53.030
I can see them. I can see them.
I can see the grapes of my homeland.

00:27:57.840 --> 00:27:59.310
Right!

00:27:59.340 --> 00:28:03.710
It's about time for the
harvest festival.

00:28:03.740 --> 00:28:07.370
How will this year's
new vintage turn out?

00:28:07.850 --> 00:28:14.410
The wine is made from grapes crushed by
the delicate feet of virgins.

00:28:14.460 --> 00:28:15.620
No...

00:28:15.660 --> 00:28:18.320
Naga, help me!

00:28:20.860 --> 00:28:25.730
Now, dear Lady, where might you be from?

00:28:28.800 --> 00:28:33.640
Did you think you could lower my morale
with Lina's Octopus Dance?

00:28:33.670 --> 00:28:34.940
How dare you underestimate me?!

00:28:34.980 --> 00:28:37.310
What?! Impossible!

00:28:37.340 --> 00:28:39.470
Stone Ghost!

00:28:56.730 --> 00:28:57.790
What in God's name?!

00:28:57.830 --> 00:28:59.160
B... B... Boss!

00:28:59.200 --> 00:29:06.110
Fear not! To an entertainer, it makes
little difference who the audience is.

00:29:06.140 --> 00:29:08.300
A true professional never shrinks
from a challenge!

00:29:08.340 --> 00:29:11.330
Where might you be from?

00:29:21.490 --> 00:29:25.750
Wow! That's really something Naga!

00:29:30.430 --> 00:29:31.920
What?

00:29:41.280 --> 00:29:43.740
Naga, it's falling down.

00:30:05.170 --> 00:30:07.690
It's on a rampage.

00:30:12.970 --> 00:30:17.340
Naga, you simply must take classes
in anatomy and perspective!

00:30:17.380 --> 00:30:19.000
Beauty is in the eye of the beholder.

00:30:19.050 --> 00:30:23.950
Your questionable aesthetics have
caused mass destruction in the city!

00:30:30.760 --> 00:30:35.060
One, two, one, two...

00:30:35.100 --> 00:30:43.230
I see. I'm impressed by the skill you
displayed in creating such a dragon.

00:30:46.640 --> 00:30:50.040
But of course! I am Naga!
Naga, the White Serpent.

00:30:50.080 --> 00:30:52.270
Naga the Serpent!

00:30:55.750 --> 00:30:59.340
And who might you be?

00:30:59.390 --> 00:31:02.150
Lina, Lina Inverse.

00:31:05.360 --> 00:31:08.290
Y... yo... you are Lina Inverse?

00:31:08.330 --> 00:31:11.990
So, the rumors were right.

00:31:12.030 --> 00:31:17.100
You are pretty small, rather skinny,
and somewhat flat-chested as well.

00:31:17.140 --> 00:31:19.000
Take this!

00:31:23.540 --> 00:31:27.340
Even if you are a king, you can push me
only so far before making me angry.

00:31:27.380 --> 00:31:30.210
What do you mean "so far?"
You're already angry.

00:31:30.250 --> 00:31:33.740
Oh no, that was just a simple drop kick.

00:31:35.760 --> 00:31:37.620
Whatever, it's unimportant.

00:31:37.660 --> 00:31:38.920
What?

00:31:38.960 --> 00:31:45.920
Come, we'll continue this conversation
later. Stay at the place tonight.

00:31:45.970 --> 00:31:48.660
Yes, that would be nice.
Why don't you do that?

00:31:49.240 --> 00:31:51.730
Now that that's been taken care of...

00:31:51.770 --> 00:31:53.740
Hey, bring food!

00:31:57.540 --> 00:32:00.910
Haven't you forgotten someone?

00:32:00.950 --> 00:32:03.780
Oh no, but I was about to.

00:32:04.380 --> 00:32:07.980
I am Lina's greatest and closest rival.

00:32:08.020 --> 00:32:11.720
You must be Ms. Naga, the sidekick.

00:32:13.860 --> 00:32:17.630
It is with great pleasure that
I welcome you to our castle.

00:32:22.470 --> 00:32:23.940
The dream again?

00:32:32.250 --> 00:32:33.680
That sword has no blade!

00:32:34.410 --> 00:32:35.570
Lesser Demon!

00:32:41.990 --> 00:32:43.150
Light come forth!

00:32:59.440 --> 00:33:03.000
That's the legendary Sword of Light.

00:33:10.050 --> 00:33:16.920
I've been waiting for you, Lina Inverse.
Welcome to the Land of the Promise.

00:33:16.960 --> 00:33:18.950
So that was you, Old Man?

00:33:18.990 --> 00:33:22.950
That's correct.
I am the great sage, Rowdy.

00:33:23.000 --> 00:33:28.900
I wish to return this island
to its proper state.

00:33:28.940 --> 00:33:35.670
I'm more concerned with getting some
sleep than the state of this island.

00:33:35.710 --> 00:33:39.170
Hear me, Lina. There is no time
for detailed explanations.

00:33:39.210 --> 00:33:44.450
Head north through the Forest of Galin.
There you'll find the Ruins of Elmgowsh!

00:33:44.480 --> 00:33:49.550
This geezer isn't listening
to a word I'm saying.

00:33:51.390 --> 00:33:55.290
Do you understand?
Go to the Ruins of Elmgowsh!

00:33:56.830 --> 00:33:59.890
Go to the Ruins of Elmgowsh!

00:34:00.400 --> 00:34:03.560
Go to the Ruins of Elmgowsh!

00:34:04.100 --> 00:34:06.070
Go to the Ruins of Elmgowsh!

00:34:09.440 --> 00:34:12.710
What are you doing, screaming into
my ears in the dead of the night?!

00:34:12.750 --> 00:34:14.940
Oh, have you awakened?

00:34:14.980 --> 00:34:18.110
You were the ones who woke me up!

00:34:23.090 --> 00:34:29.960
Beyond the ruins to our north, there is
another village on Mipross Island.

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:34.490
The hot springs originate in that
village and are channeled to this side.

00:34:34.530 --> 00:34:39.030
About a year ago, demonic beasts
began to inhabit the ruins.

00:34:39.070 --> 00:34:41.400
Demonic beasts?

00:34:41.440 --> 00:34:44.810
We sent expeditionary forces into
the ruins a number of times.

00:34:44.850 --> 00:34:50.810
But those who returned say things that
make no sense. Something about a frog.

00:34:50.850 --> 00:34:54.010
We still don't have a clear idea as
to what their true nature is.

00:34:54.050 --> 00:35:00.360
We've lost all contact with the village,
and the water has dried up.

00:35:00.390 --> 00:35:02.790
And I believe it was
about a month ago...

00:35:02.830 --> 00:35:09.430
Yes, we began to have dreams of this
Rowdy who claims to be a great sage.

00:35:09.470 --> 00:35:11.490
You too?

00:35:11.540 --> 00:35:16.700
Yes, and according to the sage,
soon Lina Inverse,

00:35:16.740 --> 00:35:21.310
a stuck-up sorceress with no cleavage
but still very skilled...

00:35:21.350 --> 00:35:26.010
It wasn't me!
It was that pretentious sage.

00:35:26.050 --> 00:35:29.350
He said to leave the beasts
to Lina Inverse.

00:35:29.390 --> 00:35:31.720
That's not what I was told!

00:35:33.230 --> 00:35:37.690
Is there no way of convincing
you to help us? I know!

00:35:37.730 --> 00:35:43.190
There's the matter of payment for the
destruction brought about by Naga.

00:35:43.240 --> 00:35:46.690
Well, that's an unrelated issue that
must be dealt with separately.

00:35:48.380 --> 00:35:52.970
I would be willing to consider
a reward for your efforts.

00:35:54.380 --> 00:35:57.510
I humbly ask that you leave
this affair to me!

00:35:58.290 --> 00:36:01.520
Here are three days worth of provisions
and the other items that you requested.

00:36:01.560 --> 00:36:05.220
I'm placing you in charge, Lina Inverse.

00:36:22.110 --> 00:36:23.970
Do you have some business with me?

00:36:25.850 --> 00:36:27.870
You're no fun.

00:36:40.490 --> 00:36:44.330
That's so funny! But I have nothing to
give you for the entertainment.

00:36:44.360 --> 00:36:45.590
Right Lina?

00:36:46.530 --> 00:36:48.900
Lina, isn't that a Sleep Berry?

00:36:48.940 --> 00:36:50.660
Yep, I'm taking off to see someone.

00:36:50.700 --> 00:36:53.100
Go see someone? What are you?

00:36:54.640 --> 00:36:56.470
Later!

00:36:58.950 --> 00:37:00.410
Let's see...

00:37:00.450 --> 00:37:03.110
So this to this and...

00:37:03.150 --> 00:37:05.850
And twist this so...

00:37:09.990 --> 00:37:12.360
What are you doing, Lina Inverse?

00:37:12.390 --> 00:37:15.160
You must hurry to the ruins! Come now!

00:37:17.300 --> 00:37:18.730
Why this is...

00:37:18.770 --> 00:37:20.130
Gotcha!

00:37:23.570 --> 00:37:30.310
You're something! No ordinary mortal
could kick me while I was in his dreams.

00:37:30.340 --> 00:37:34.210
What are you talking about?
This was my dream to begin with.

00:37:34.250 --> 00:37:37.150
As long as I believe it,
I can do anything.

00:37:37.180 --> 00:37:38.740
Isn't that right?

00:37:41.860 --> 00:37:45.450
All right then, it's time for you
explain all of this in detail.

00:37:45.990 --> 00:37:48.390
You ask me to explain but...

00:37:48.430 --> 00:37:52.760
Well you need my help, right?

00:37:54.730 --> 00:38:01.140
When you've grown as old as I am, you
can see just a bit into the near future.

00:38:01.170 --> 00:38:09.170
So even though this is a request from
me, it has a lot to do with you as well.

00:38:09.920 --> 00:38:15.950
Nevertheless, compensation is required
if you want someone to do as you ask!

00:38:15.990 --> 00:38:18.050
Compensation...

00:38:21.860 --> 00:38:23.760
Hey, cut it out!

00:38:23.800 --> 00:38:27.730
It just so happens that there's this hot
spring that only I know of...

00:38:27.770 --> 00:38:28.600
Hot spring?

00:38:28.640 --> 00:38:34.870
Yes, this is a secret, but the spring is
called the Fountain of Growth.

00:38:36.240 --> 00:38:41.700
In another words the hot spring
accelerates your growth!

00:38:41.750 --> 00:38:44.910
Accelerates growth?

00:38:44.950 --> 00:38:48.010
I'd grow taller and

00:38:48.760 --> 00:38:52.710
my breasts would get bigger?

00:38:52.760 --> 00:38:57.250
All right! You have a deal!

00:38:59.400 --> 00:39:02.560
Leave it all to me, Rowdy.

00:39:13.710 --> 00:39:18.620
Let's go, Naga! Time to get to the
ruins! C'mon, we don't have all day!

00:39:18.650 --> 00:39:20.180
Explosion Array!

00:39:34.870 --> 00:39:41.070
All right, let's have a talk with this
nice beast everyone keeps talking about.

00:39:49.580 --> 00:39:55.680
I hate all these ruins and dungeons.
They're always dark and damp.

00:40:00.860 --> 00:40:01.720
I guess...

00:40:01.760 --> 00:40:04.420
It's trying to welcome us.

00:40:05.170 --> 00:40:06.500
Looks like this calls for...

00:40:06.530 --> 00:40:08.300
An all out assault.

00:40:10.840 --> 00:40:13.360
Earth Spirit Road!

00:40:16.080 --> 00:40:17.510
We'll take the most direct route.

00:40:17.540 --> 00:40:18.530
Sounds good.

00:40:26.890 --> 00:40:29.410
This must be the deepest level.

00:40:30.390 --> 00:40:31.880
Here it is!

00:41:13.770 --> 00:41:15.790
This is the demonic beast they
were talking about?

00:41:15.840 --> 00:41:20.770
It's also probably the "Great Master"
the hotel owner was talking about.

00:41:21.780 --> 00:41:24.510
It makes no difference to me
what sort of master you are.

00:41:24.540 --> 00:41:27.670
Shouldn't there be a vast
treasure trove in here?

00:41:43.730 --> 00:41:47.030
Yes, yes! Look at all that loot!

00:41:47.070 --> 00:41:48.730
Hey, wait Naga!

00:41:54.640 --> 00:41:56.610
Such treasures!

00:41:56.640 --> 00:41:59.700
I've had about enough from you!
Shadow snap!

00:42:01.750 --> 00:42:04.440
Stay still for just awhile.

00:42:17.530 --> 00:42:22.130
Looks like we can have some fun.
Eh, Lina Inverse?

00:42:22.170 --> 00:42:25.260
Would you be so kind as to
tell me your name then?

00:42:25.310 --> 00:42:27.800
Call me Joyrock.

00:42:27.840 --> 00:42:34.840
So Joyrock, what are you up to? Making
money by manipulating the citizens?

00:42:34.880 --> 00:42:37.610
Hogging the hot springs all to yourself!
And on that note!

00:42:37.650 --> 00:42:40.450
Demonic Crystal!

00:42:43.760 --> 00:42:47.250
You shouldn't let your guard down like
that, my cute little Joyrock.

00:42:47.830 --> 00:42:50.260
A futile attempt.

00:42:54.670 --> 00:42:56.860
Looks like my turn.

00:42:57.370 --> 00:43:00.340
Are you going to show me
something special?

00:43:00.370 --> 00:43:04.070
Oh no, this is just a simple trick
I keep up my sleeve.

00:43:04.110 --> 00:43:05.540
Guard Flair!

00:43:10.480 --> 00:43:12.750
He did a spatial shift?!

00:43:12.790 --> 00:43:14.010
He must be...

00:43:14.050 --> 00:43:15.490
A demon!

00:43:15.960 --> 00:43:16.940
Lina!

00:43:21.160 --> 00:43:23.860
You move pretty fast.

00:43:25.530 --> 00:43:28.260
So that's your true appearance?

00:43:28.300 --> 00:43:35.710
Shape and form are meaningless to me.
Is there a shape you wish me to take?

00:43:35.740 --> 00:43:37.970
There's no need for that.

00:43:43.420 --> 00:43:49.320
Not to quote that old geezer but,
"The fun is just beginning!"

00:43:52.160 --> 00:43:53.990
We've gotta get out of here, Naga!

00:43:54.030 --> 00:43:56.120
What about all this treasure?!

00:43:56.160 --> 00:43:58.320
Oh, you can come back for it later!

00:43:58.360 --> 00:44:00.130
The treasure!

00:44:00.170 --> 00:44:01.860
Raywing!

00:44:22.360 --> 00:44:26.290
Sorry to bother you, but may we
have some water to drink?

00:44:26.330 --> 00:44:29.690
Why certainly, that's easy enough to do.

00:44:29.730 --> 00:44:30.820
Thank you.

00:44:30.860 --> 00:44:33.490
No problem. By the way who
would you be?

00:44:33.730 --> 00:44:38.190
My name is Lina, Lina Inverse.
This is Naga.

00:44:38.240 --> 00:44:40.570
Ah, Lina...

00:44:42.910 --> 00:44:49.250
Lina... Inverse...

00:44:53.120 --> 00:45:00.120
Lina... Inverse...

00:45:04.730 --> 00:45:06.630
Oh my God, that was disgusting!

00:45:06.670 --> 00:45:08.690
Here let me borrow this for a second!

00:45:08.740 --> 00:45:10.790
Hey, wait a minute.
What do you think you're doing?

00:45:10.840 --> 00:45:11.900
Don't worry!

00:45:11.940 --> 00:45:14.670
Let me go!

00:45:19.050 --> 00:45:20.640
Who are you laughing at?

00:45:20.680 --> 00:45:22.740
You're fun to watch,
and I bet you taste good too.

00:45:22.780 --> 00:45:24.840
Fun?

00:45:24.880 --> 00:45:29.650
I thought demons subsisted on
human fear and suffering?

00:45:29.690 --> 00:45:35.490
There are all sorts of people out there,
and each has a different flavor.

00:45:35.530 --> 00:45:37.520
Just like every demon has
an individual appetite.

00:45:38.930 --> 00:45:45.890
You see the various emotions of humans
are like delightful, exotic seasonings.

00:45:45.940 --> 00:45:49.840
I see. So you did that to them?

00:45:49.880 --> 00:45:53.740
Lina...

00:45:55.250 --> 00:45:55.810
Right.

00:45:55.850 --> 00:45:57.910
Rotten bastard!

00:45:57.950 --> 00:46:03.480
If you want to have fun and play,
do it alone and at your own expense!

00:46:03.520 --> 00:46:07.020
The people on this island
are not your toys!

00:46:07.060 --> 00:46:12.360
Oh, but they are! Human beings are
nothing more than my toys!

00:46:13.170 --> 00:46:14.960
Like this!

00:46:19.740 --> 00:46:21.570
Kack Tai Chyawak

00:46:36.660 --> 00:46:39.750
You see? Just toys.

00:46:39.790 --> 00:46:43.520
Y... y... you bastard!

00:46:43.560 --> 00:46:49.090
What's this? Are you getting angry?
Oh, I love it!

00:46:49.140 --> 00:46:55.440
The anger and fear that humans
experience are true delicacies for me!

00:46:56.910 --> 00:47:00.470
Are we ready to fight now?

00:47:03.520 --> 00:47:06.970
Your conduct is so deplorable that even
I cannot help but be outraged.

00:47:07.320 --> 00:47:08.980
Get out of the way, Naga.

00:47:14.760 --> 00:47:18.060
Heed me, oh spirits darker than dusk

00:47:19.230 --> 00:47:21.700
Red beyond crimson flow like blood

00:47:21.730 --> 00:47:23.530
What would that be?

00:47:23.570 --> 00:47:29.010
In the name of those reduced to dust

00:47:29.780 --> 00:47:32.240
I pray to the shadows

00:47:32.280 --> 00:47:33.940
Hey...

00:47:33.980 --> 00:47:37.010
Mark ye these villains that bar our way

00:47:37.050 --> 00:47:38.570
This can't be.

00:47:38.620 --> 00:47:41.140
And to my small strength thine own ally

00:47:42.760 --> 00:47:44.990
To deliver doom, folly repay

00:47:45.020 --> 00:47:46.750
I don't believe this.

00:47:46.790 --> 00:47:49.790
Come judgement from the grave

00:47:49.830 --> 00:47:52.390
Dragon Slave!

00:48:19.460 --> 00:48:20.220
D'ya get him?

00:48:20.260 --> 00:48:21.750
I think so.

00:48:22.830 --> 00:48:24.730
Don't celebrate just yet!

00:48:24.960 --> 00:48:26.760
You're not getting away!

00:48:31.970 --> 00:48:37.030
Hey, you know, that hurt.
Oh no you don't!

00:48:37.840 --> 00:48:41.410
Don't move. I'm genuinely surprised.

00:48:41.450 --> 00:48:45.750
I never thought a human such as yourself
could unleash something like that.

00:48:47.450 --> 00:48:50.250
You've become an obstacle
to my entertainment.

00:48:50.290 --> 00:48:51.690
Die!

00:48:55.430 --> 00:48:57.330
What?!

00:48:58.870 --> 00:49:00.460
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:49:00.500 --> 00:49:02.660
Old Man!

00:49:03.970 --> 00:49:08.410
I wondered who it was. Why, it's Rowdy,
the grandpa that never dies.

00:49:08.440 --> 00:49:10.170
That would be me.

00:49:10.210 --> 00:49:12.510
Wow, listen to your nerve!

00:49:12.550 --> 00:49:18.420
I wanted to keep at least one of you
around just to make things interesting,

00:49:18.450 --> 00:49:22.180
but the three of you together are
becoming an annoyance.

00:49:22.220 --> 00:49:25.660
Too bad, I'll retreat for now.

00:49:29.130 --> 00:49:31.430
Do you need a hand?

00:49:46.880 --> 00:49:50.680
Well, it's about time I
explained everything.

00:49:50.980 --> 00:49:56.350
This is Meliroon and myself
as we were long, long ago.

00:49:56.390 --> 00:50:03.450
This island was once close enough
to walk to the continent and back.

00:50:03.500 --> 00:50:06.830
At least until he came.

00:50:06.870 --> 00:50:08.130
He?

00:50:08.170 --> 00:50:10.070
You're referring to Joyrock?

00:50:13.440 --> 00:50:17.810
It was the day of the elves'
annual village festival.

00:50:22.320 --> 00:50:29.620
He came just as the festivities
were in full swing and

00:50:29.660 --> 00:50:33.650
that was when the slaughter began.

00:50:45.040 --> 00:50:46.370
As I rushed toward the village
a lesser demon appeared.

00:50:46.410 --> 00:50:48.030
I slew him, but it was too late.

00:50:51.040 --> 00:50:58.470
The elven village lay in ashes,
and only the monsters remained.

00:51:06.860 --> 00:51:11.800
Knowing I had little chance of victory,
I lunged toward Joyrock.

00:51:11.830 --> 00:51:17.240
Sadly, I couldn't even scratch him.

00:51:21.740 --> 00:51:28.440
And so Joyrock, faded away into
the darkness laughing aloud.

00:51:59.280 --> 00:52:05.840
That was when the island withdrew
itself from the world

00:52:05.890 --> 00:52:10.910
and started to follow time in
a different manner than usual.

00:52:10.960 --> 00:52:16.520
Since then, I have lived on for what
seems like an eternity

00:52:16.560 --> 00:52:21.230
unable to die and comforting
the soul of Meliroon.

00:52:21.270 --> 00:52:23.830
Are you still in love with her?

00:52:26.370 --> 00:52:31.610
But after many ages Joyrock
has returned,

00:52:31.640 --> 00:52:36.140
and I know what must be done.

00:52:36.180 --> 00:52:41.120
Are you talking about changing the past?

00:52:46.260 --> 00:52:51.130
To change the past that was not meant to
be and create the present that should be

00:52:51.160 --> 00:52:54.220
that is what this island cries out for.

00:52:55.630 --> 00:52:56.900
Here they come!

00:52:58.470 --> 00:53:00.630
Freeze Arrow!

00:53:04.740 --> 00:53:06.440
Blast Ash!

00:53:12.950 --> 00:53:15.790
Elmikian Lance!

00:53:26.030 --> 00:53:28.000
One down!

00:53:28.030 --> 00:53:29.760
Damn it!

00:53:31.600 --> 00:53:35.200
I've waited for this, Joyrock!

00:53:35.240 --> 00:53:36.730
What?!

00:53:38.280 --> 00:53:40.140
This time,

00:53:40.180 --> 00:53:43.380
the wishes of this island,

00:53:43.780 --> 00:53:47.780
my soul and your magic!

00:53:50.020 --> 00:53:55.620
Everything is in its place.
The gates of time shall now open!

00:53:55.660 --> 00:53:57.320
This is impossible!

00:54:31.730 --> 00:54:37.190
Lina, take this!
This is the last of my power!

00:54:38.740 --> 00:54:41.430
Hey! Where do you think you're going?!

00:54:42.070 --> 00:54:47.810
I waited countless unending nights and
days for this opportunity to arrive.

00:54:47.850 --> 00:54:52.720
You're my last hope, Lina Inverse
and that other girl!

00:54:52.750 --> 00:54:58.050
What do you mean, "that other girl"?!
I have a name!

00:55:22.280 --> 00:55:23.840
Guard Flair!

00:55:28.290 --> 00:55:30.260
Looks like I made it in time.

00:55:34.230 --> 00:55:38.820
So, you must be Lina Inverse.

00:55:40.530 --> 00:55:43.230
Me? My name is...

00:55:46.270 --> 00:55:50.730
I know, Rowdy Gabrielf, isn't it?
Now then, it's time to get going!

00:55:50.780 --> 00:55:52.440
Raywing!

00:56:15.230 --> 00:56:17.100
Rowdy!

00:56:17.140 --> 00:56:18.540
Meliroon...

00:56:21.570 --> 00:56:23.340
Blast Ash!

00:56:26.180 --> 00:56:29.640
Wh... what?!

00:56:31.080 --> 00:56:35.950
So, we meet again for the
first time, Joyrock.

00:56:37.190 --> 00:56:42.720
What nonsense are you talking about?
Would you like to play, little girl?

00:56:42.760 --> 00:56:46.290
Well, all right.
I'm willing to play with you.

00:56:46.330 --> 00:56:47.990
Enough!

00:56:49.170 --> 00:56:50.530
Blue Magic Wave!

00:57:02.280 --> 00:57:03.310
Rowdy!

00:57:03.680 --> 00:57:05.740
Flair Pit!

00:57:10.360 --> 00:57:12.120
A worthless attack!

00:57:17.700 --> 00:57:22.930
Say, isn't that sword known
as the Sword of Light?

00:57:22.970 --> 00:57:25.460
Heed me, oh spirits darker than dusk

00:57:25.900 --> 00:57:28.530
C'mon, show it to me.

00:57:28.570 --> 00:57:31.910
In the name of those reduced to dust

00:57:36.380 --> 00:57:39.410
To deliver doom, folly repay

00:57:39.450 --> 00:57:42.150
Come judgement from the grave

00:57:42.760 --> 00:57:45.850
Dragon Slave!

00:58:26.000 --> 00:58:27.800
C'mon, Rowdy.

00:58:27.830 --> 00:58:28.730
No way!

00:58:28.770 --> 00:58:30.170
Greedy brat!

00:58:30.200 --> 00:58:35.830
This sword has been in my family for
generations. I can't just give it away.

00:58:40.910 --> 00:58:42.400
Looks like it's time for me to go.

00:58:42.450 --> 00:58:44.470
Ms. Lina...

00:58:44.520 --> 00:58:46.310
Thank you.

00:58:56.060 --> 00:58:58.890
Where have you been, Naga?

00:58:58.930 --> 00:59:01.990
Shut up! How should I know?

00:59:02.030 --> 00:59:04.500
Then you must've been stuck in here.

00:59:04.540 --> 00:59:07.370
Give me your hand, Naga!
Or else you won't be able to get back.

00:59:09.840 --> 00:59:12.830
Well all right, I will but only
because you asked me.

00:59:18.550 --> 00:59:24.980
Now, Lina Inverse was it, what is this
reward you are talking about?

00:59:25.020 --> 00:59:29.960
Yes, this is the first time we've met.

00:59:37.870 --> 00:59:42.810
Wow, history really has been altered.
I guess it can be done after all.

00:59:42.840 --> 00:59:47.510
Hey, wait a minute!
Naga, I just remembered something.

00:59:47.550 --> 00:59:49.510
I'll catch up with you later, so go
ahead to the harbor, all right?

00:59:49.550 --> 00:59:52.210
Sorry about this. Raywing!

01:00:13.640 --> 01:00:17.600
Hey you, would you happen to have a
spring called the Fountain of Growth?

01:00:17.640 --> 01:00:20.200
Yep, it's just right around back.

01:00:20.250 --> 01:00:22.270
Yes! Thank you!

01:00:26.650 --> 01:00:29.490
Ta-dah!

01:00:30.420 --> 01:00:31.890
Oh boy, oh boy, oh boy.

01:00:31.920 --> 01:00:33.690
What the hell d'ya think you're doing?!

01:00:33.730 --> 01:00:35.390
Hey, that hurt!

01:00:35.430 --> 01:00:37.360
Watch what you're doing!

01:00:40.430 --> 01:00:45.730
This hot spring is used for the
accelerated cultivation of vegetables.

01:00:45.770 --> 01:00:47.740
Now if you were to jump in...

01:00:52.380 --> 01:00:57.340
If you'd just hopped right on in, you'd
be a wrinkly old grandma in no time!

01:00:57.380 --> 01:00:58.610
Grandma?

01:00:58.680 --> 01:01:02.310
Good, you understand. It's always best
to leave that stuff up to nature.

01:01:10.400 --> 01:01:12.800
Old Man!

01:01:12.830 --> 01:01:14.990
Thank God you came back safely.

01:01:15.030 --> 01:01:18.200
Thank God nothing happened to me,
but what about this! This! This!

01:01:18.240 --> 01:01:20.500
Why, this is the Fountain of Growth.

01:01:20.540 --> 01:01:23.130
Yeah that's right! This was the most
import thing in this deal!

01:01:23.180 --> 01:01:27.410
Hey, Lina Inverse, you know
what they say...

01:01:27.450 --> 01:01:30.710
Be careful what you wish for.

01:01:30.750 --> 01:01:32.740
That's not fair!

01:01:35.390 --> 01:01:40.150
Lina Inverse, thank you very much.

01:01:41.560 --> 01:01:43.260
Good bye.

01:01:48.630 --> 01:01:50.030
Oh well...

01:01:54.470 --> 01:01:57.840
Oh Naga, why, it's you!

01:02:03.050 --> 01:02:05.110
What's going on here?

01:02:05.150 --> 01:02:10.320
Oh, you know... It was...

01:02:10.360 --> 01:02:12.950
Nothing was going on!

01:02:14.790 --> 01:02:18.230
Did you think you could
get away from me?

01:02:18.660 --> 01:02:22.230
I said it was nothing! Nothing!

01:02:26.440 --> 01:02:28.430
Give it up, Lina!

01:03:56.330 --> 01:03:59.300
Yeah, here comes the Dragon Slave!

01:03:59.330 --> 01:04:01.770
Well then, here's my Sword of Light!
